sequenceDiagram
  actor O as Owner
  participant D as Daily Sales Report
  participant W as Weekly Sales Report
  participant U as Unpaid Accounts
  participant E as Export Report
  participant S as Server
  O->>D: 1: Open Sales
  D->>S: 2: GET /api/sales/daily?date=
  S-->>D: 3: Money earned, unpaid, gallons, orders list
  O->>D: 4: Tap the date arrows or Weekly
  D->>W: 5: Open Weekly (money per day, compared with last week)
  W->>S: 6: GET /api/sales/weekly
  O->>D: 7: Tap Unpaid
  D->>U: 8: Open Unpaid Accounts (per customer, search)
  O->>U: 9: Open a customer, Mark paid
  U->>S: 10: POST /api/admin/orders/{id}/paid
  S-->>U: 11: Total owed goes down
  O->>D: 12: Tap Export
  D->>E: 13: Choose report (daily, weekly, unpaid) and PDF or spreadsheet
  E->>S: 14: POST /api/export, then GET /api/export/file
  S-->>E: 15: File saved on the phone or downloaded
